      "writtenOn": "2020-04-06T22:10:37Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "We can just conditionally compile this file based on $(CONFIG_CMD_KEYBOARD) in the Makefile?\n\nA bit cleaner imo, since this is the only thing in the file.",
